    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nForkin Earls are delighted to present this well maintained and deceptively spacious two-bedroom mid-terrace home to the market. Ideally positioned within a small and established residential development of just five homes on the Milehouse Road, this attractive property enjoys a superb location within easy walking distance of Enniscorthy town centre and an excellent range of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés and public transport links.\n\nOriginally constructed around 2004, the property offering generous and well-proportioned accommodation is presented in good condition throughout. Ready for immediate occupation, this home will appeal to first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors seeking a quality property in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe accommodation has been designed with comfortable modern living in mind. A welcoming entrance lobby leads to a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area. Fitted with an extensive range of floor and eye-level units, generous worktop space, and French doors opening onto the rear garden, this is an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining. A practical guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms together with a family bathroom.\n\nOutside, the property continues to impress. To the front, is a communal driveway which provides off-street parking for two vehicles. The fully enclosed rear garden has been designed with low maintenance in mind and enjoys excellent privacy, featuring a patio area, gravelled area for low maintenance, and gated rear access.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, and a highly convenient location, this is a home that offers exceptional value and is sure to attract strong interest. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWelcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring and a wooden staircase leading to the first floor.\n\nKitchen / Dining / Living Area - \nA bright and spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, designed for modern family living. The kitchen features tiled flooring and is fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units, an integrated oven and hob with extractor hood, washing machine, tumble dryer, and fridge freezer. A tiled splashback and matching tiling around the kitchen units provide a stylish and practical finish.The living and dining area benefits from a large window overlooking the rear garden, flooding the space with natural light. Laminate wood flooring runs throughout the living area, which also includes a TV point and a convenient understairs storage cupboard.\n\nGuest WC - \nComprising WC and wash hand basin with tiled flooring, tiled splashback and wall-mounted mirror.\n\nLanding - \nBright landing area with laminate wood flooring and access to the attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nSpacious double bedroom with dual-aspect windows overlooking the rear garden, built-in wardrobes and laminate wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nDouble bedroom overlooking the front of the property, complete with built-in wardrobes and laminate wood flooring.\n\nMain Bathroom - \nWell-appointed bathroom comprising a corner shower with Triton T90 electric shower, WC and wash hand basin. Finished with tiled flooring and tiled splashback.\n\nRear Garden - \nLow-maintenance rear garden with a paved patio area and gravel finish, enclosed by fencing with a pedestrian gate providing convenient side access to the front of the property.\n\nOutside - \nThe front of the property features an attractive cobble-lock driveway providing off-street parking for two cars. The private rear garden is fully enclosed with fencing and walls, offering excellent privacy and rear gated access. Designed for ease of maintenance, it includes patio areas, mature planting and excellent outdoor living space.\n\nServices - \n• Mains water, sewage and electricity.• Electric central heating.• Broadband and satellite tv available in the area.\n\nLocation - \nLocated in the residential development of Milehouse Mews, Milehouse road, this address affords such ease of access to a range of amenities to include Centra/Service station, Aldi/Lidl supermarkets and Enniscorthy Community college. You are also never too far away from the main town of Enniscorthy which provides further, supermarkets, shops, schools, restaurants, bars, chemists, to name only a few. Enniscorthy also offers a range of transport links to Dublin/ Wexford and only a few minutes drive to the M11 Motorway for only an hours drive to Co. Dublin. A most convenient address!\n\nDirections - \nY21WR74From the top of Enniscorthy town (at Pettitts Supermarket) continue along the R702 Bellefield Road out of town, at the roundabout opposite Lidl and Aldi, keep Right straight through small roundabout and continue out this road, and Milehouse Mews will be 350m on left hand side, no 3 is located within this small development.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Ideal first-time buyer, downsizer or investment opportunity.</li><li> Ready for immediate occupation.</li><li> Well presented two-bedroom mid-terrace residence, approx. 64.63 sq. m. (696 sq. ft.).</li><li> Private, low-maintenance rear garden with patio area and rear gated access leading to the front.</li><li> Off street communal parking for two cars.</li><li> Small, quite residential development of just five homes, within walking distance of Enniscorthy town centre.</li><li> uPVC double-glazed windows and doors.</ul>"
      },
